com/a/pKlPLat。重要資訊： - 摩根應該擁有與露西娜（參考右側圖像中的女性）相同的藍色頭髮和眼睛。 - 我還希望包括參考圖像中的劍和盾牌。請避免在盾牌後面遮蓋過多的身體。如需更多有用的參考圖像和靈感，請參閱我過去請求的範例：https://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/15vlgpWHqhG_XyIYrZw4_dPvMcCHr6Q8s 感謝您的寶貴時間。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/TSAs1uR", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@unc_ntg/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2011463, "client_id": 3044987, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d68dec9d/uploads/origins/00a934b7-fae1-482f-b059-f3bed1c5b969?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12aa2958dd0440e6b61b780100a25409", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d68dec9d/uploads/origins/00a934b7-fae1-482f-b059-f3bed1c5b969?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12aa2958dd0440e6b61b780100a25409, https://si.imgix.net/d68dec9d/uploads/origins/00a934b7-fae1-482f-b059-f3bed1c5b969?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a018e268a4f9135c02dcf662af87fef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d68dec9d/uploads/origins/00a934b7-fae1-482f-b059-f3bed1c5b969?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7ab35989ec423fc084fd5f4d97985e3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d68dec9d/uploads/origins/00a934b7-fae1-482f-b059-f3bed1c5b969?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9479e1691282de4c0d58dc2151930d35", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d68dec9d/uploads/origins/00a934b7-fae1-482f-b059-f3bed1c5b969?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9479e1691282de4c0d58dc2151930d35, https://si.imgix.net/d68dec9d/uploads/origins/00a934b7-fae1-482f-b059-f3bed1c5b969?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c9415b5a5693a33c5abe57aa84f5cd0a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d68dec9d/uploads/origins/00a934b7-fae1-482f-b059-f3bed1c5b969?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3ce23afcdf68463a2716f142a9b4b42a 3x"}, "body": "你好！我想知道你是否可以和《風花雪月》中的 Dimitri 一起畫我的 OC Inna。關於我的OC 的詳細資訊：請閱讀她的參考表以獲取更多詳細資訊：(https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vvBOKg6XIMcMjaZsVciIA6rwRlK8WJiV/view?usp=sharing) 在她的服裝外面，請確保她穿著藍色斗篷我已經包含在文件夾中了。請確保她沒有戴面紗。它應該是這樣的：（https://drive.google.com/file/d/16MEEa9XrrAr2RJ3SrSh4Bmr4QvO1R_jN/view?usp=share_link）。我看到你的作品（https://skeb.jp/@unc_ntg/works/1）並認為它可能有點相似。我想要一些東西來象徵，儘管他們生活中充滿了悲劇，但他們的愛能夠治癒他們。請在藝術品中註明他們所穿的藍色。也許兩人可以坐在中間，手牽著手，享受一段平靜的時光，而外面卻有骷髏和手試圖爬行並抓住他們。如果您願意，您可以自由地加入血液。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mMZ2Mo05QMCrUydr4UB5I_3-kuPiEV29?usp=share_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@unc_ntg/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2011463, "client_id": 2459948, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a5f8032/uploads/origins/2d88ec9d-5429-4f8c-a30d-13ab0020dd35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a6c29c0b1d49de876aeb5b579af48d7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2a5f8032/uploads/origins/2d88ec9d-5429-4f8c-a30d-13ab0020dd35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a6c29c0b1d49de876aeb5b579af48d7, https://si.imgix.net/2a5f8032/uploads/origins/2d88ec9d-5429-4f8c-a30d-13ab0020dd35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=709d298df59b6692999da3f1c3bdd435 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2a5f8032/uploads/origins/2d88ec9d-5429-4f8c-a30d-13ab0020dd35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aaf188b9e0e53c8cee43fac113bfdc0d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_ur