e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7edc950/uploads/origins/735ddbd3-6d1a-41ea-a46a-900fad21b069?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e89ef333bbe0d668070e2e5f32136292 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7edc950/uploads/origins/735ddbd3-6d1a-41ea-a46a-900fad21b069?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f9c075134cfe82742fe68ec18bfc793", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7edc950/uploads/origins/735ddbd3-6d1a-41ea-a46a-900fad21b069?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f9c075134cfe82742fe68ec18bfc793, https://si.imgix.net/a7edc950/uploads/origins/735ddbd3-6d1a-41ea-a46a-900fad21b069?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ad0513117b208a0cd44d77b726e3f031 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7edc950/uploads/origins/735ddbd3-6d1a-41ea-a46a-900fad21b069?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a08ae4bdb5d7fd8f01f2ea5bb70f9753 3x"}, "body": "老師好！ ！特別喜歡老師的風格，特別是老師之前畫過的宗教題材的插圖非常好看🥺 如果可以的話這邊也想約一張宗教元素的插圖……想約我家兩位oc，他們的世界觀是架空中世紀末文藝復興初期如果可以的話想要約兩張，每張一個人物，但是是同一個場景： 1️⃣男妖精被封教會管理人（類似於樞機主教）在教堂大廳的台階上跪下受封的樣子，光從玻璃花窗透進來神聖的畫面。 2️⃣人類的男孩在眾人的背後，教會旁邊走廊的柱子後面憧憬愛慕地看著這一切，妖精老師在他心裡就是他的神，手上拿著百合花與紅書本第2️⃣張插圖可以簡單一些草有些也沒事，主要是第1️⃣張插圖，希望能畫出壽命論，神聖的光輝與無奈的命運感。 （ps：妖精老師的印像是四大天師中的拉斐爾） 兩個人的關係可以參考資料夾！他們兩個的元素是鳶尾花與百合。服裝請用教會paro裡的長款服飾，或者只有妖精老師的服飾可以稍微做點改變（比如披著華麗一些的外套什麼的，完全可以任意參考教會元素。 也請您考慮一下！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-HW2ILj4DcIeEb05Scu3pg4leB3G_h_m", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@unc_ntg/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2011463, "client_id": 829593, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/564b0152/uploads/origins/b9c01338-0886-4286-841f-4d8c0d11a94a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=473678cfa20b912b10f44e6787222050", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/564b0152/uploads/origins/b9c01338-0886-4286-841f-4d8c0d11a94a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=473678cfa20b912b10f44e6787222050, https://si.imgix.net/564b0152/uploads/origins/b9c01338-0886-4286-841f-4d8c0d11a94a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8537eac364513eecd7f3f6bd2837c593 2x, https://si.imgix.net/564b0152/uploads/origins/b9c01338-0886-4286-841f-4d8c0d11a94a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa6f5a5beffe8f393653b35ad7c40b05 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/564b0152/uploads/origins/b9c01338-0886-4286-841f-4d8c0d11a94a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=81e183b090c69e3507c019ef14a9a6a5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/564b0152/uploads/origins/b9c01338-0886-4286-841f-4d8c0d11a94a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=81e183b090c69e3507c019ef14a9a6a5, https://si.imgix.net/564b0152/uploads/origins/b9c01338-0886-4286-841f-4d8c0d11a94a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2b82333bbf54ec27e02a266f655a7b85 2x, https://si.imgix.net/564b0152/uploads/origins/b9c01338-0886-4286-841f-4d8c0d11a94a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=762802e12419a963c677752e87de85ef 3x"}, "body": "你好! 我和我的朋友非常喜歡你的插圖我想知道你是否願意為LUMI和LAUREL做一幅插圖。這幅插圖將是兩人第一次見面時的情景。在莊園的背景中，有一個慶祝活動正在發生。同時LAUREL和LUMI在外面的花園裡。 LUMI正在沉思（要么抬頭看星星，要么看倒影池。） LAUREL會在他身後，對LUMI說起命運和神靈。 LAUREL被他的上級命令殺死LUMI。然而，這段對話最終讓LAUREL感到好奇，導致他放過了LUMI。 LAUREL應該穿著參考資料中的chiton。 LUMI可以穿著參考資料中的一件衣服，或者你可以自由地設計。他總是穿著露出肚子的衣服。 https://imgur.com/a/zgkg9HN 人物https://imgur.com/a/m7uKa9K - 請笑一笑這些棍子。也有背景圖片。非常感謝您的考慮! 由於英文的字數限制，我是用中文發送的!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@unc_ntg/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2011463, "client_id": 1101059, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ff8ca28/uploads/origins/87ec2d6e-babf-47f6-9466-bf34e71aa121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83ec5cd62cbb7e14bffdede00769d04e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4ff8ca28/uploads/origins/87ec2d6e-babf-47f6-9466-bf34e71aa121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=83ec5cd62cbb7e14bffdede00769d04e, https://si.imgix.net/4ff8ca28/uploads/origins/87ec2d6e-babf-47f6-9466-bf34e71aa121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bd73279ae68ec8b215869a0b21918a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4ff8ca28/uploads/origins/87ec2d6e-babf-47f6-9466-bf34e71aa121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e1d944964e3a26e16cd68813270a4fe 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ff8ca28/uploads/origins/87ec2d6e-babf-47f6-9466-bf34e71aa121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cbbc234b5f8176087aa8cf44311ca2ed", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4ff8ca28/uploads/origins/87ec2d6e-babf-47f6-9466-bf34e71aa121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cbbc234b5f8176087aa8cf44311ca2ed, https://si.imgix.net/4ff8ca28/uploads/origins/87ec2d6e-babf-47f6-9466-bf34e71aa121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7a0e87fa7ee11d3883fe58dfe7a770f7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4ff8ca28/uploads/origins/87ec2d6e-babf-47f6-9466-bf34e71aa121?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e4fac3b5dd6c5458da5a6b432a4cb098 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Your art is very beautiful! Could you draw 沙僧(沙悟淨) in 《西遊記》 in your art style? Please don't shave his hair because what I'd like to request you to draw is him when he lived in the 流沙河. The following are excerpts from 《西遊記》: 青不青，黑不黑，晦氣色臉；長不長，短不短，赤腳筋軀。眼光閃爍，好似灶底雙燈；口角丫叉，就如屠家火缽。獠牙撐劍刃，紅髮亂蓬鬆。 （《西遊記》第八回） 一頭紅焰發蓬鬆，兩隻圓睛亮似燈。不黑不青藍靛臉，如雷如鼓老龍聲。身披一領鵝黃氅，腰束雙攢露白藤。項下骷髏懸九個，手持寶杖甚崢嶸。 （《西遊記》第二十二回） 他生得身長丈二，臂闊三停，臉如藍靛，口似血盆，眼光閃灼，牙齒排釘。 （《西遊記》第二十九回） 降妖寶杖: 吳剛伐下一枝來，魯班製造工夫蓋。裡邊一條金趁心，外邊萬道珠絲玠。 （…） 或長或短任吾心，要細要粗憑意態。 （《西遊記》第二十二回） You can draw him with your character design as you like based on the descriptions about his appearance in 《西遊記》. For example, I don't care if you change freely his body size such as his height. Please give priority to your aesthetic sense. I'd like you to draw him dancing with a headless skeleton of a man like the Dance of Death among a lot of human bones at the bottom of the 流沙河. Please cancel this request without reserve if it isn't acceptable for you. Thank you!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@unc_ntg/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2011463, "client_id": 1377136, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/27a2adb0/uploads/origins/f06cdabc-ce83-4582-8c1c-a40a536a9e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21ece082824c66a479abf198772c9407", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/27a2adb0/uploads/origins/f06cdabc-ce83-4582-8c1c-a40a536a9e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21ece082824c66a479abf198772c9407, https://si.imgix.net/27a2adb0/uploads/origins/f06cdabc-ce83-4582-8c1c-a40a536a9e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9301417a3ad62a03e2ae33a7229cec5d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/27a2adb0/uploads/origins/f06cdabc-ce83-4582-8c1c-a40a536a9e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=011cb69e6b6661a7aab05f7c765c6070 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/27a2adb0/uploads/origins/f06cdabc-ce83-4582-8c1c-a40a536a9e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a5b341df5ed70b07fae1e43d3c5ae218", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/27a2adb0/uploads/origins/f06cdabc-ce83-4582-8c1c-a40a536a9e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a5b341df5ed70b07fae1e43d3c5ae218, https://si.imgix.net/27a2adb0/uploads/origins/f06cdabc-ce83-4582-8c1c-a40a536a9e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45a049e09f7f08e4f31f06de791dcfdd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/27a2adb0/uploads/origins/f06cdabc-ce83-4582-8c1c-a40a536a9e59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06b94085b8999cde986a50abf3a486b7 3x"}, "body": "再次問好，硝酸鹽先生。很抱歉第三次再次打擾您，但我一直對動畫印象深刻，所以這次我再次提出要求。這次，我想請求我的兩個原創角色和我朋友的兩個原創角色的插圖。人物參考：https://imgur.com/a/zgkg9HN, https://imgur.com/a/cBQc0gX 服裝/設定參考：https://imgur.com/a/s5r9UDr 提示：這是來自前一次這是一個具有不同世界觀的設置。這次是在中世紀的奇幻場景中，一個牧師和一個惡魔與我朋友的原始角色一起旅行。在這幅插圖中，四個角色被邀請參加在貴族宅邸舉行的豪華晚宴。然而，食物和飲料都是有毒的，我希望插圖的氣氛是黑暗和荒涼的。我要你根據氣氛給四個人換衣服。我已經包含了服裝和設置的參考想法，但請隨意解釋提示。如果您不喜歡，請隨時拒絕。我真的很感謝你。 （文字是日文的，因為我無法適應英文的字數限制。）", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@unc_ntg/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/beaa09ed/uploads/origins/3a41d1dd-f89a-4027-bcb7-bf05d0b7aa22?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=022dc7f5d05db38a83d59044e0faed95", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/beaa09ed/uploads/origins/3a41d1dd-f89a-4027-bcb7-bf05d0b7aa2